---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Compare the true cost of owning cars in India">
	{/* Hero Section */}
	<div class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-20 sm:py-28 border-b border-slate-800">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
			<span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wide uppercase bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-400 border border-blue-800 mb-6">
				Data-driven insights
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
				<span class="block text-slate-100">The true cost of</span>
				<span class="block text-blue-500 mt-2">owning cars in India.</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-400 font-medium">
				Independent calculations using transparent assumptions you can change. Understand real on-road prices, running costs, EMIs, and resale value.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
				<a href="/compare" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 border border-transparent text-base font-bold rounded-lg text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/20">
					Start Comparison
				</a>
				<a href="/calculators/total-cost-of-ownership" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 border border-slate-700 text-base font-bold rounded-lg text-white bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors">
					View Methodology
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	{/* Main Reports Section */}
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
		<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-8 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Calculators & Reports</h2>
			<a href="/calculators" class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">View all &rarr;</a>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
			
			<a href="/compare" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
				<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
					<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">N-Car Comparison</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed flex-grow">Compare 5-year TCO across multiple variants side-by-side.</p>
			</a>

			<a href="/calculators/fuel-cost" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
				<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-slate-800 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
					<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Fuel Cost Calculator</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed flex-grow">Calculate precise monthly and annual fuel expenses based on live prices.</p>
			</a>

			<a href="/calculators/ev-charging-cost" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-green-300 transition-all">
				<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-50 text-green-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-green-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
					<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">EV Charging Cost</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed flex-grow">Blend your home and public charging ratios to find true EV running costs.</p>
			</a>

			<a href="/calculators/emi" class="group flex flex-col bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 transition-all">
				<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-slate-800 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
					<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Loan & EMI</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed flex-grow">Plan your car loan with a complete breakdown of principal and interest.</p>
			</a>

		</div>
	</div>

	{/* Trust / Data Principles Section */}
	<div class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-20">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
				<div>
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">Built on rigorous automotive data.</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8 font-medium">We don't sell cars or loans. Our platform is designed as an objective, data-first utility to bring transparency to the Indian automotive market.</p>
					
					<dl class="space-y-6">
						<div class="flex">
							<div class="flex-shrink-0">
								<div class="flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 font-bold">1</div>
							</div>
							<div class="ml-4">
								<dt class="text-lg leading-6 font-bold text-slate-900">Provenanced Data</dt>
								<dd class="mt-1 text-base text-slate-500 font-medium">Every spec is tagged with its source—from OEM Official to Derived Estimates—so you know exactly what to trust.</dd>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex">
							<div class="flex-shrink-0">
								<div class="flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 font-bold">2</div>
							</div>
							<div class="ml-4">
								<dt class="text-lg leading-6 font-bold text-slate-900">Customizable Variables</dt>
								<dd class="mt-1 text-base text-slate-500 font-medium">Don't agree with ARAI mileage claims? You can override our assumptions to match your real-world usage.</dd>
							</div>
						</div>
					</dl>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm">
					{/* Mock Data Dashboard UI Element */}
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-200 pb-4">
							<div>
								<p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Example Output</p>
								<h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">Economic TCO</h4>
							</div>
							<span class="bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">100% Confidence</span>
						</div>
						<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
							<div>
								<p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">Acquisition</p>
								<p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">₹ 15,00,000</p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">Energy (5 Yrs)</p>
								<p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">₹ 4,87,500</p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">Depreciation</p>
								<p class="text-lg font-bold text-red-600">- ₹ 6,75,000</p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<p class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">Net Loss</p>
								<p class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">₹ 13,12,500</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
